 in Korea.', 'original_day': '2026-07-24'}]}]}, {'thread_id': 'g2', 'name': 'SK Telecom AI factory rollout', 'scope': 'The planned Korea AI Cloud and AI factory build, including the announced scale, deployment and first-factory operational milestone.', 'seq': 2, 'input_id': 'nvidianews:sk-group-and-nvidia-expand-strategic-partnership-across-ai-factories-and-next-generation-memory', 'members': [{'view_id': 'v2', 'question': 'Will the first SK Telecom AI factory described in the SK Group–NVIDIA partnership come online by December 31, 2027?', 'seq': 2, 'input_id': 'nvidianews:sk-group-and-nvidia-expand-strategic-partnership-across-ai-factories-and-next-generation-memory', 'evidence': [{'evidence_id': 'e2', 'quote': 'This cloud will use the NVIDIA ® DSX™ platform and deploy NVIDIA Vera Rubin accelerated computing powered by SK hynix HBM4, with the first AI factory planned to come online in 2027.', 'original_day': '2026-07-24'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3', 'quote': 'Today’s announcement builds on the decades-long technology partnership between SK Group and NVIDIA, including the recently announced plans for SK Telecom to build a 2-gigawatt-scale AI Cloud in Korea.', 'original_day': '2026-07-24'}]}]}]
