    16	EXTRACT_MEMBERSHIP = """ Assign each proposed thesis to the continuing business subject it concerns.
    17	Reuse an existing_subjects ID, or declare a new subject in threads. Describe an ongoing product rollout,
    18	investment program, demand cycle or policy process, including its separate milestones, customers and dates.
    19	A company alone is too broad. Related theses share IDs; a thesis may belong to several subjects.
    20	This is research membership, not a claim that the events are identical or causal."""
